# Force LF for anything executed by a shell or a CI runner.
#
# Added 2026-08-06 (QUAL-08). 10 of the 23 execution/tests/*.sh scripts had
# CRLF line endings and therefore failed under `bash` on a Linux runner before
# reaching their first `dfx canister call` — a breakage entirely separate from,
# and hidden behind, the dead-method problem in the same suite. Normalizing the
# files fixes today; this file stops a Windows checkout from reintroducing it.
#
# A regression guard also exists in
# frontend/src/__tests__/legacyShellScripts.test.ts.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf

# Motoko, TS/JS and config: normalize in the repo, LF on checkout.
*.mo text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.did text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.wasm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
